[{"title":"夫椒山","author":"侯让","text":"曾闻吴越此交锋，回首苏台霸业空。\n当日空岩流战血，至今衰草起腥风。\n裹尸国士浮江上，覆面君王死甬东。\n若论灭吴功第一，捧心人在馆娃宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20958,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"狄仁杰","author":"侯让","text":"牝鸡声里夜茫然，唐室无人鼎欲迁。\n太子十年恩遣日，祖君一语力回天。\n奸谀似草锄将尽，国祚如丝断复连。\n若论中兴诸将相，此翁勋业合居先。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20959,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"申明亭庵","author":"金闻","text":"乘胜寻游入翠微，森森竹柏护禅扉。\n无心洲石鸥寻梦，有意枝头鸟趁衣。\n变易沧桑山色在，兴亡吴越浪花飞。\n悠然会得无生语，直欲因僧买钓矶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20960,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早春过顾使君春草阁","author":"何汝健","text":"柳色日夜绿，东风来自兹。\n阁中杨子草，池上谢公诗。\n薜作垣衣暗，峰回云带奇。\n西濠新月白，归去棹犹夷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20961,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游冶山","author":"何栋如","text":"闻说百峰山最奇，到来秋色更离披。\n地当吴楚东南会，寺有齐梁禅代时。\n云气欲迷丹凤阙，雨珠先洒白龙池。\n翠华驻跸知何处，拟问山僧骑已驰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20962,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒日山中","author":"胡涍","text":"寒近不可御，拿云云满身。\n撑肠贮冰雪，叉手看松筠。\n骨立青山在，颜衰白首贫。\n谁家尚高冢，落日卧麒麟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20963,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过雅宜别业","author":"胡涍","text":"不见王摩诘，犹馀华子冈。\n隔河山杳霭，断树水微茫。\n有子开松径，留宾正夕阳。\n渔舟投暝合，杯外即沧浪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20964,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"碧山吟社遗址","author":"胡时忠","text":"百年残碣翠堪扪，吟骨虽寒品地尊。\n盛世遗民皆自得，空山流水不曾浑。\n楚亡岂识春申涧，晋末还余谢傅墩。\n沧海桑田谁后死，有人涕泪赋招魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20965,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过听松庵有感","author":"陆志","text":"万壑闲云满径苔，松关刚对翠屏开。\n翻经座冷猿长啸，施食庭空鸟不来。\n尘翳中书留画壁，雨荒丞相读书台。\n石泉澄澈僧留茗，两腋清风一快哉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20966,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赏徐园紫薇花","author":"陆志","text":"名应星垣色相奇，不将浓艳媚春时。\n赏筵雅爱临歌扇，草诏曾看落砚池。\n漫诵泛香元献赋，朗吟为伴乐天诗。\n月明风爽南州宅，衰老宁辞酒百卮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20967,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉林花朝开社次原韵","author":"陆勉","text":"汲得龙渊水一瓢，试茶先趁社前邀。\n语超尘境都忘倦，路入山光不觉遥。\n修竹茂林思往事，雨香云淡属花朝。\n年年此会须乘兴，莫遣东君叹寂寥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20968,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹炉和韵","author":"陆勉","text":"竹炉元供定中禅，久落红尘复此年。\n雪乳漫烹香细细，湘纹重拂翠娟娟。\n远公衣钵还为侣，老守文章最有缘。\n犹爱风流王内翰，旧题佳句至今传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20969,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题秦氏南湖草堂","author":"陆勉","text":"太湖南畔隐君家，小小柴门对白沙。\n竹灶茶香浮玉乳，瓷缸酒熟趁梨花。\n风轩净扫开吟社，水槛新添泊钓槎。\n我欲画拈书籍卖，结茅相伴老烟霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20970,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"半山","author":"陆九州","text":"山深翠微寒，飞花乱如雨。\n轻风抽布帆，落日在高树。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20971,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荆溪","author":"陆九州","text":"东风静卷游丝长，桃花吹落流水香。\n美人照水芙蓉裳。\n兰桡玉腕击波去，欲来不来空断肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20972,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东林习静有感","author":"刘元珍","text":"三窟经营计独周，谁知身世一浮鸥。\n沧桑迭换须臾景，舜蹠初分万古忧。\n看到尽头机自息，证通来脉体全休。\n人人共有真归宿，何事纷纭角斗牛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20973,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次钱启新先生丽泽堂韵","author":"刘元珍","text":"地撼山摇戒炯严，反观无事复何添。\n已从羑里寻遗迹，更向韦编筮褔谦。\n折尽老梅春自到，射余雏鸟气先占。\n纷纷过眼嗟乌有，硕果甘来喜自拈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20974,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题报恩寺方丈","author":"刘宏","text":"洒帚高台放眼宽，一尊携客暂盘桓。\n门连翠嶂市声远，窗锁白云秋色阑。\n僧定自知龙钵冷，客来谁识鹤巢寒。\n西风半夜萧萧竹，使我篝灯几度看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20975,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪兔","author":"刘容","text":"北山云暝雪齐腰，老鹘狞然立树梢。\n长啸一声风飒飒，草间狐兔总魂消。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20976,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"城东避暑次廉伯陆先生元韵二首 其一","author":"吕卣","text":"避暑城东十里行，旁人休诧是逃名。\n丹崖碧水开仙府，风格龙楼仰帝京。\n冠盖登临增地胜，笙歌清绝带泉声。\n惭予归自西台晚，未得相逢共咀英。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20977,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"城东避暑次廉伯陆先生元韵二首 其二","author":"吕卣","text":"暑气蒸人欲濯川，群公郊野喜镳连。\n追凉合坐池边树，医俗还寻竹里廛。\n耕凿不知恩似海，笑谈忘却日如年。\n诗成东阁翘材馆，留与君家作胜传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20978,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"巨枫诗","author":"吕铭","text":"宋世谁培双干枫，隆隆秀起逼层峰。\n高标倍可追三桧，古邑真堪匹五松。\n春雨香凝千点绿，秋风叶改万枝红。\n山人不辩何年物，趺坐浓阴咏化工。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20979,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题吴御史西台遗恨卷","author":"吕元夫","text":"甘雨才看遍大梁，不堪传讣自江乡。\n千金重寄凭危发，一恨终天枉断肠。\n古树乌啼霜正落，西台鹤梦夜偏长。\n显扬赢得封章在，千载佳城草木香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20980,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送僧还钟山","author":"李琛","text":"归去来兮钟山中，钟山万仞盘苍龙。\n御炉香霭随天风，方今混一四海同。\n何用祝发归禅宗，松楸寂寞霜露浓。\n送君之去月堕空，浩浩大化何终穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20981,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"幽居","author":"李进（孟昭","text":"雨后看新水，天空望远山。\n入云苍隼健，坐浪白鸥閒。\n酒尽壶还贳，诗成字重删。\n才疏信樗散，非为惜朱颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20982,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题栖云庵","author":"李戣","text":"旧种闲云足自怡，溶溶曳曳共栖迟。\n阴笼法座花千片，影压秪林玉万枝。\n纸张晓惊眠觉后，衲衣寒怯定回时。\n由来此是无情物，只合常年伴阿师。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20983,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜吟社新成简听玉","author":"李庶","text":"论交共有斯文契，结社欣逢至治年。\n道谊相资期化俗，词章何用学通仙。\n亭台落日烟霞里，杖履清风水玉边。\n珍重杨雄偏好静，竹门深锁白云连。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20984,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旅况","author":"李文麟","text":"旅况澹如此，羁身复若何。\n家书春后少，乡思雨中多。\n浮食一官系，衔恩十载过。\n不才吾自耻，焉敢叹蹉跎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20985,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"源师栖云庵","author":"李戬","text":"一片闲云懒作霖，悠悠偏契老禅心。\n袈裟挂影晴犹湿，笃耨熏炉气自沉。\n出岫不随飞锡远，护关长是住山深。\n我来欲借倪床卧，咫尺西岩杳莫寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20986,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"张中丞殿落成","author":"罗柔","text":"天宝人豪浩气横，当年殉国死犹生。\n出奇漫折蒿为矢，制胜能令草作兵。\n手抚疮痍还突阵，口含茶纸更登城。\n要知灵武迥銮日，半是睢阳金鼓声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20987,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西山小集和敏斋韵","author":"罗柔","text":"小桥编竹贴沟底，入画青山满屋西。\n谁倩黄鹂坐高柳，嘤嘤偏向落红啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20988,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"听雨惠山","author":"马世奇","text":"偶尔成三笑，俄惊度九秋。\n汀迷曾宿客，树系欲行舟。\n酒劲风殴碎，灯清雨解愁。\n翻嫌人意冷，永夕为天留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20989,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"惠山杂诗三首 其一","author":"马世奇","text":"山中了山政，一榻亦华胥。\n石涧鱼通道，篱亭鸟卜居。\n树稀青嶂密，窗小白云疏。\n犹酌歌招隐，翛然兴有余。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20990,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"惠山杂诗三首 其二","author":"马世奇","text":"偶然三径里，别有一天开。\n壁老衣为藓，山深路是苔。\n睡凭莺唤觉，书倩鹤衔来。\n坐待僧归尽，闲云尚未回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20991,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"惠山杂诗三首 其三","author":"马世奇","text":"言寻黄绮约，小筑近山尖。\n揽翠云添色，云凉日解严。\n松声归枕角，梧影落书笺。\n性癖耽幽寂，僧来亦可嫌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20992,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泰伯乡","author":"马世奇","text":"古城湮旧迹，遗恨寄沧桑。\n蛙部留荒苑，萤灯剩野塘。\n箫来吹市散，梅尽教村凉。\n犹见溪山外，寒鸦戍夕阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20993,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉蝶梅花二首 其一 醉梅","author":"马世奇","text":"夜寂朱栏待素娥，不禁冷艳带微酡。\n一般愁绪牵春色，醒处何如醉处多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20994,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉蝶梅花二首 其二 醒梅","author":"马世奇","text":"雨暮云朝不洗妆，微调朱粉试寒芳。\n舞回纨袖香魂醒，赢得西施白玉床。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20995,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秦淮曲","author":"马世奇","text":"万骑南巡正德年，内家前队铁连钱。\n白衣舞罢乘鸾去，应有霓裳曲未传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20996,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠曹元宰守漳州","author":"马世奇","text":"灵查秋泛海天凉，五夜心悬燕寝香。\n总为至尊忧社稷，汉臣何必薄淮阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20997,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠郑少府之任","author":"马世奇","text":"宦薄无妨吏隐尊，清风一拂百年存。\n流移满目谁堪绘，念尔监门旧子孙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20998,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过延陵道","author":"马世奇","text":"道出延陵一水遥，追寻遗迹问先朝。\n青山如旧人何在，故国虽残德未消。\n柳掩吴宫门寂寂，雨迷驿路草萧萧。\n最怜季子家声远，古庙松衫半已凋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20999,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜宿皇山","author":"马世奇","text":"清夜宿层峦，情怀旷远天。\n平墟红叶落，梅里白云连。\n泰伯墓临麓，梁鸿宅在颠。\n鹅湖渔水近，崧岭斗牛悬。\n秋晚迷飞霭，泉声出远川。\n鸣鸦集古树，归鸟依芦滩。\n夜响闻天籁，萧萧动客船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21000,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为白司寇题画","author":"莫骢","text":"万山晴色一囊琴，夹岸长松十里阴。\n天上故人归未得，草堂花雨昼沉沉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21001,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"易箦时作","author":"莫息","text":"青山郁郁树苍苍，不是桃源路渺茫。\n露沁石根芝草润，风生涧底茯苓香。\n唤醒枕上南柯梦，离脱人间傀儡场。\n万古英雄皆白骨，只宜含笑入泉乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21002,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"顾洞阳招与清溪雅集感成待柬致谢","author":"莫同","text":"重阳喜无雨，况复菊初黄。\n相约中林士，来寻五柳庄。\n沙平围鸭栅，水落露鱼梁。\n共话羲皇上，罍倾未解航。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21003,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"碧山复旧社喜作","author":"莫同","text":"诘旦饰仆夫，乘春寻旧山。\n扬舲渡莲蓉，九点青烟鬟。\n祁祁啸徒侣，相见俱开颜。\n仲春梅未落，布席瑶林间。\n行厨出芳醑，僧灶飏茶烟。\n合坐循齿序，嗣德歆前贤。\n新规出意创，义例楣间悬。\n嚣尘喜远隔，逸思来无端。\n吾侪惜短景，觞咏有余欢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21004,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日始作社会","author":"莫同","text":"溪边杨柳欲藏鸦，旧社重寻感岁华。\n龙缝漫流冰后乳，阳坡新摘雨前芽。\n有僧住处聊为主，无事来时即为家。\n却笑荆公专一壑，暮年诗句亦吟差。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21005,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阅耕","author":"莫懋","text":"策杖看耕图，拖云出深谷。\n回头日未斜，还可将书读。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21006,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"莫懋","text":"危危孤峰高，磊落在天地。\n写作画图看，湿云飞不起。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21007,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"真性海竹茶炉","author":"莫士安","text":"一炉周绕护琅玕，圆上方中量自宽。\n水火相煎僧事少，枪旗无扰睡魔安。\n煖红炙汗枯霜节，沸白浇花逗月团。\n留共梅窗清啜罢，雪楼谁道酒杯寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21008,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃花坞","author":"莫士安","text":"岁岁桃花满坞开，花明遍映讲经台。\n未愁红雨催春去，要为金仙献果来。\n涧道东风非梓泽，石桥流水似天台。\n何当剩种瑶池核，不用凡根取次栽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21009,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别占城","author":"倪峻","text":"奉使占城四月留，今朝策马欲登舟。\n风传鼓角残云卷，日映旌旗宿雾收。\n马援不来人尽仰，张骞归去若为俦。\n明年金阙朝元日，还造鹓行拜冕旒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21010,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日","author":"倪峻","text":"远客伤秋思，虚堂独掩扉。\n墙阴鸣落叶，窗隙漏斜晖。\n感物题新句，寻人补旧衣。\n因思蘧伯玉，点检昔年非。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21011,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄鹤楼","author":"倪敬","text":"黄鹤高楼今尚在，黄鹤高飞几千载。\n黄鹤仙人不复回，空余江水东流海。\n谁能搥碎黄鹤楼，谁能踢翻鹦鹉洲。\n诗人吾已轻崔灏，明月清风且放舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21012,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鹦鹉洲","author":"倪敬","text":"芳洲水暖蒲牙吐，健笔何人赋鹦鹉。\n江山不解壮登临，徒使行人悲往古。\n书生才气锐于锋，曹黄三子那能容。\n君不见南阳人龙正高卧，三顾起来续炎祚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21013,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"惠山泉","author":"倪敬","text":"喷壑西来起白虹，奔冲势欲倒危峰。\n双池涵空浴雨曜，一气化云从九龙。\n香带落花红滚滚，细穿修竹绿溶溶。\n一瓢会入调羹鼎，未必中泠世所宗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21014,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落凤坡二首 其一","author":"倪容","text":"先主何心袭益州，士元抵死设奇谋。\n秋原依旧平于掌，落凤坡前鸟雀愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21015,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落凤坡二首 其二","author":"倪容","text":"谈笑隆中起卧龙，地图况已出张松。\n中山帝胄安天下，谁遣将军触箭锋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21016,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹炉诗","author":"倪祚","text":"清风只合近孤禅，华屋徒留五十年。\n竹格总如前度好，瓷瓯那得旧时娟。\n鬓丝吟榻全真趣，松火清流断俗缘。\n物理往还虽不定，芳名须藉后人传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21017,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈行之风翰亭","author":"浦鼎","text":"缥亭人似玉堂仙，月肺云肝泻峡泉。\n词藻引毫归宝唾，笔花拖梦上蛮笺。\n墨池暖涨桃花雨，书壁凉飘柿叶烟。\n气窄紫鳌清浅水，神游黄鹄泬寥天。\n红鹅价博黄庭卷，白雪声和锦瑟弦。\n五凤文章天上待，三都词赋洛中传。\n荷巾未逐秋风老，铁砚磨云已半穿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21018,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题秦氏南湖草堂","author":"浦鼎","text":"频年鱼鸟识风流，家在南湖烟树头。\n隔槛残云飞白凤，漫沙曲水走青虬。\n浣花茅屋牵萝补，甫里芝田为鹤谋。\n词客醉看书叶字，小娃歌踏采菱舟。\n掀髯华月生莲渚，欹枕寒潮响荻洲。\n江燕雨吹琴荐湿，鲤鱼风飐钓丝柔。\n诗题彩笔天吴泣，书照青藜太乙游。\n夜夜文光贯牛斗，南阳肯作卧龙休。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21019,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登泰山作","author":"浦应麒","text":"缥缈碧霞君，千秋秘玉文。\n高寒晴欲雪，空翠湿为云。\n石势参天涌，钟声遍地闻。\n兹游揽奇胜，真欲绝尘氛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21020,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵强德州","author":"浦应麒","text":"林屋秋高已自凉，山中新酒熟鹅黄。\n银丝岂必鲈鱼脍，金粟齐飘桂树香。\n泉石最宜微著雨，芙蓉犹好未经霜。\n临流不尽归桡兴，隔水渔灯见小航。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21021,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"社会勉倡一首聊为先资","author":"浦应麒","text":"向来枉驾逢炎暑，今度修盟属岁寒。\n自信温凉曾饱历，何期宾主罄交欢。\n鸥凫沙霁仍烟水，鸿鹄天高正羽翰。\n况是吾侪冰蘖伴，宁需桃李到春盘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21022,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吟会次秦封君倡韵一首","author":"浦应麒","text":"金风吹柳褪烟丝，恰是黄花缀锦时。\n屈指虽经重九过，赏心还与岁寒期。\n松云流翠醒尘眼，庭柚分甘饫密脾。\n赋得归来同囗隐，陶然共醉碧山卮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21023,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"石城","author":"浦羲升","text":"挂席秋江上，凉生薜荔衣。\n雨声芦叶偃，风色浪花飞。\n方度龙潭驿，随过燕子矶。\n石头城下泊，坐对月霏微。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21024,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]